// The Meet Stella guide: the HTML page under Stella's first message. Every
// app carries this copy and opens it in its viewer, so it works signed out and
// offline. The first line names its "try this" buttons (see canvas-actions.ts).
//
// Its films are the original onboarding demos (errands, shopping, work, build,
// routines, memory and self-change), recorded from those components as a
// poster plus the DOM changes at each cue; a small inline script replays them.
// They never autoplay: each rests on its poster, just before "send", with a
// Play button, and offers Replay when done. Edit the HTML here; it is one
// string so no build step is needed.
